  message: "Drift accumulated since item creation: commit 7310783e1 (DEDUP_TOKENS bump 50000->100000, log_injection_history() writer added, PLAYBOOKS registry summary regenerated 14->19) and commit 9ac06cc88 (per-session DEST/PID rewrite, removal of legacy global session-token mechanism). Both modify the watcher infra without per-entry cohort markers, so the v0 snapshot this cutover takes will now span more unmarked drift than originally documented. Also corrected the file path in the description: the watcher lives at .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py, not under packages/hypergumbo-tracker/. Status remains needs_human_review."  # e589
